# CIRO: Situation Cockpit Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
CIRO is a premium cyber-situation cockpit designed to monitor emergency signals, resolve coordinates, allocate logistics units, and render visual map forensics inside situation rooms. This plan details the architectural integrations, the isolated cooperative 4-agent matrix, front-end optimization loops, and the recent code compliance standardizations implemented to achieve perfect lint status and POSIX compatibility.

---

